; A SQUARE — somewhere that is not a fight.
;
; The spawn numbers are the same numbers. What stands on them is a person, a thing, a grave and a
; way out rather than two foes, and that is the whole difference between a room you fight in and a
; place you live in. Same format, same reader, same board (PLACES_AND_PERSISTENCE.md).
;
;   .  floor      ~  difficult ground   #  rock      @  the hero starts
;   1-9 a spawn   |  wall up a line     -  wall along a line   x  door, shut   +  a corner

